{"id":1493,"date":"2026-05-28T08:19:48","date_gmt":"2026-05-28T08:19:48","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/?p=1493"},"modified":"2026-08-06T06:08:11","modified_gmt":"2026-08-06T06:08:11","slug":"python-interview-questions-and-answers","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/python-interview-questions-and-answers\/","title":{"rendered":"130+ Python Interview Questions and Answers (2026 Updated)"},"content":{"rendered":"\n<p>Python is one of the most popular <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/best-programming-languages\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">programming languages<\/a> used for web development, data science, automation, <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/what-is-artificial-intelligence\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">artificial intelligence<\/a>, and software development. Its simple syntax and powerful features make it a preferred choice for both beginners and professional developers.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Due to its growing demand, many companies hire Python developers for technical roles. To perform well in interviews, candidates should have a strong understanding of Python concepts and programming logic.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Practicing interview questions on <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/resources\/python\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Python programming<\/a> is one of the best ways to improve confidence and strengthen your coding abilities. It also helps you become familiar with the questions commonly asked by recruiters and hiring managers.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>In this blog, we have compiled important Python interview questions and answers for freshers and experienced candidates. These questions will help you improve your knowledge and prepare confidently for interviews.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Introduction to Python Programming Language<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>The Python programming language was developed and introduced by Guido van Rossum on 20 February 1991. It is one of the most used languages because of its applications in modern technologies like <a href=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/data-science\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\">Data Science<\/a>, Machine Learning, and Artificial Intelligence (AI).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It is a free-to-use and open-source language with an easy syntax. Also, Python is a general-purpose language based on the concept of object-oriented programming (OOP).<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>Python is a dynamic type of language with the feature of portability that has extensive support for libraries.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">What is the Scope of Python Programming?<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Python is considered the best option for developing games and programs efficiently. With support for multiple programs, Python is the preferred choice for all future technologies such as AI, ML, and data science.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>It also has broad community support and has way better code readability. The Python developer interview questions mentioned in this comprehensive write-up will challenge your knowledge and improve your arsenal, which will land you in a great pool of opportunities.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<h3 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Python has a very good future scope in various sectors:<\/h3>\n\n\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li>Desktop GUI application<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Console-based applications<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Game development<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Software development<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Audio and video applications<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Image processing applications<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Internet of Things<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Machine learning<\/li>\n\n\n\n<li>Artificial intelligence<\/li>\n<\/ul>\n\n\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Things to Know While Preparing for Python Interview Questions and Answers<\/h2>\n\n\n\n<p>Before attending a Python interview, make sure you understand core concepts such as data types, functions, object-oriented programming, exception handling, file handling, and data structures. Strong fundamentals will help you answer both theoretical and coding-based interview questions for Python with confidence.<\/p>\n\n\n\n<p>You should also stay updated with technologies such as Artificial Intelligence (AI), Machine Learning (ML), and Data Science. Interviewers may ask questions related to these areas to assess your technical knowledge and problem-solving abilities.<\/p>\n\n\n\n    <!-- LOTTIE SCRIPT -->\n    <script src=\"https:\/\/unpkg.com\/@lottiefiles\/lottie-player@latest\/dist\/lottie-player.js\"><\/script>\n\n    <section class=\"wscube-courses mb-2\">\n        <div class=\"container\">\n            <h3 class=\"mb-4\">Recommended Professional <\/br> Certificates<\/h3>\n\n            <div class=\"owl-carousel courseOwl\">\n\n                \n                    \n                    <div class=\"course-card card-r rounded-4\">\n\n                        <!-- \u2705 SINGLE MEDIA DIV (FIXED) -->\n                        <div class=\"course-media\"\n                             data-lottie=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/uploads\/images\/courses\/json-images\/web-devlopment.json\"\n                             data-fallback=\"https:\/\/www.wscubetech.com\/blog\/wp-content\/themes\/newwscube\/assets\/imges\/Image.png\">\n                        <\/div>\n\n                        <div class=\"card-body\">\n                            <h5>Full Stack Development Course with AI Engineering<\/h5>\n\n                            <p class=\"rating\">\n                                4.9 \u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\u2605\n                                (24922)\n                            <\/p>\n\n                            <ul class=\"course-meta\">\n                                <li>\ud83d\udc64 27000 Learners<\/li>\n                                <li>\u23f1 20 Weeks<\/li>\n                            <\/ul>\n\n                            <div class=\"mt-3\">\n                                                      